		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Memory Leak in btMLCPSolver]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=42567#p42567"><![CDATA[
~btMLCPSolver should delete m_solver; given that m_solver was newed. Right now it leaks instead, especially during: ~btConstraintSolverPoolMt. Which is how I Discovered this issue. Another solution is to not have the ~btConstraintSolverPoolMt delete anything, which I would prefer.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=6400">nickak2003</a> — Sat Jan 11, 2020 8:26 pm</p><hr />
